        "id": 225930,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-13T17:15:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would say thematically the idea is not that Wraith is shooting a stun bolt just once.&nbsp; When you use that power as long as Wraith is around that target she is continuing to hit that target. &nbsp; When she leaves for another Battle Zone she isn’t hitting them anymore but if they together again she continues with her spray of Stun Bolts. &nbsp;</p>",
