        "id": 225932,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-13T18:12:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, but then why does it continue to work if she gets removed from the game entirely?</p>\n<p>The way I handle it at home is that getting moved to the other zone is basically like being removed from the game.&nbsp; It's easy, consistent to implement, and makes intuitive sense.</p>",
