      {
        "id": 225935,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-13T19:23:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thematically it works for me and nothing said so far has really changed my view. &nbsp;I would say the same applies vice versa. &nbsp;&nbsp;Bottom line whether you like the ruling or not for any reason it&nbsp;is the ruling we have. &nbsp; If you don’t go by that on Tabletop or use your own rules nothing will stop you. &nbsp; However, if you play digitally that is what you should&nbsp;expect when playing in that form. &nbsp;</p>",
